 {"type": "numbered", "text": "5. Fill in the details below: (a) District and Tehsil ........................ (b) Religion ........................ (c) Date of Birth ........................"},
 {"type": "numbered", "text": "6. Parents/Guardians Occupation, Income (As applicable)"},
 {"type": "table", "rows": [["Particulars", "Education", "Occupation", "Income per month"], ["(i) Father", "........", "........", "........"], ["(ii) Mother", "........", "........", "........"], ["(iii) Guardian", "........", "........", "........"]]},
 {"type": "numbered", "text": "7. Educational Record (Commencing from Matriculation)"},
